              "content": "<p>Retrieve a list of notations for a given FactSet identifier, grouped by regional identifiers, if available. Listings without a regional identifier are grouped at the end of the response.</p><p>The notation corresponding to the security's primary listing has the attributes <big><tt>regional.isPrimary</tt></big> and <big><tt>regional.listing.isPrimary</tt></big> both set to true.The security's primary listing might not be among the results depending on the entitlement.</p><p>See the group description for more information about the security's primary listing.</p>",
